      "writtenOn": "2019-03-15T03:29:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I see, if we want to also pass not only answer but also query in onAnswer, then use 2 type Q and T.\nI think we could do it in other CL. What do you think combine so many query parameter into a class like Junyu\u0027s suggestion?",
      "parentUuid": "e6be26f1_d16c6233",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 200,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 200,
        "endChar": 21
      },
      "revId": "ff477e36475211c6797c54c122e77209688a4a6d",
